        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: اجرت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اجرت — ujrat — \"wages; payment for work\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مزدوروں کو ان کی اجرت شام کو ملتی ہے۔ mazdūroṅ ko un kī ujrat shām ko miltī hai. The labourers get their wages in the evening."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اجرت (ujrat) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic ujra, \"a wage, a fee\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
